@startuml Flow_Route_1_Email_to_BuyOffer
!define PRIMARY #2E86AB
!define SUCCESS #A8DADC
!define WARNING #FFA400
!define ERROR #E63946
!define INFO #90C3C8
!define BACKGROUND #F1FAEE

skinparam backgroundColor BACKGROUND
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor PRIMARY
    BorderColor #1D3557
    FontColor white
    FontSize 14
    FontStyle bold
}
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1D3557
    ArrowFontSize 12
    LifeLineBackgroundColor SUCCESS
    LifeLineBorderColor #457B9D
    MessageAlign center
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor INFO
    BorderColor #457B9D
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:20><b>Flow Route 1: Email → Item → BuyOffer</b></size>\n<size:12>Complete Message Transfer and Processing Flow</size>

actor User #FFA400
participant "Content Script\n(Email Matcher)" as EmailCS
participant "Background Service\n(Message Router)" as BG
participant "Email Executor" as EmailExec
database "ConfigService\n(Chrome Storage)" as Config
participant "Tab Service" as TabSvc
participant "Content Script\n(Item Matcher)" as ItemCS
participant "Item Executor" as ItemExec
participant "Content Script\n(BuyOffer Matcher)" as BuyCS
participant "BuyOffer Executor" as BuyExec
participant "Image API\n(OCR Service)" as ImageAPI
participant "Web Page\n(HanseMerkur)" as Web

== Phase 1: Email Detection and Initialization ==

User -> Web: Navigate to Outlook\n(https://outlook.office.com/mail/*)
activate Web #SUCCESS

Web -> EmailCS: Page Load Event\n[DOM Ready]
activate EmailCS #PRIMARY

EmailCS -> EmailCS: checkAndRun()\n- Validate URL pattern\n- Check DOM preconditions
note right of EmailCS: DOM Preconditions:\n- Selector: [aria-label*="HanseMerkur"]\n- shouldExist: true\n- timeout: 5000ms

EmailCS -> EmailCS: registerMatcher(emailMatcher)\n- id: MATCHER_IDS.EMAIL\n- priority: 10

EmailCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.getConfig')</color>
activate BG #WARNING

BG -> Config: getConfig()
activate Config #INFO
Config --> BG: {config, enabled}
deactivate Config

BG --> EmailCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>\n{success: true, data: {config, enabled}}
deactivate BG

alt Extension Enabled & Email Mode Active
    EmailCS -> EmailCS: Log.info('Email matcher activated')
    
    EmailCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('email.openUnreadAndClickLink')</color>\nwith selectors:
    note right: Selectors:\n- unreadEmail: '[aria-label^="Ungelesen HanseMerkur"]'\n- emailBody: '#x_body a'\n- markAsReadButton: 'span'
    activate BG #WARNING
    
    == Phase 2: Email Processing ==
    
    BG -> BG: emailCommandHandler()\n- Validate sender tab\n- Create ExecutionContext
    note left of BG: ExecutionContext:\n- tabId: sender.tab.id\n- url: sender.tab.url\n- matcherId: MATCHER_IDS.EMAIL\n- config: loaded config\n- timeout: 30000ms\n- dryRun: false
    
    BG -> EmailExec: chrome.scripting.executeScript()\n__emailExecutor(context, selectors)
    activate EmailExec #PRIMARY
    
    EmailExec -> EmailExec: Setup refresh timer\nrandom(30-60)s
    
    EmailExec -> Web: document.querySelectorAll()\n[aria-label^="Ungelesen HanseMerkur"]
    Web --> EmailExec: Unread emails list
    
    loop For each unread email
        EmailExec -> Web: clickWithVerification(email)
        Web --> EmailExec: Email opened
        
        EmailExec -> EmailExec: sleep(1000ms)\nWait for content
        
        EmailExec -> Web: waitForSelector('#x_body a')\n{timeout: 3000, visible: true}
        Web --> EmailExec: Link element found
        
        EmailExec -> EmailExec: FlowUtils.parseIDFromPath(href)\nExtract flow ID from URL
        note right: ID extraction pattern:\n/item.php?id=([A-Z0-9]+)
        
        EmailExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.startFlow')</color>
        note right: Flow data:\n- type: 'email'\n- id: parsed ID\n- title: link text\n- href: link URL
        
        BG -> Config: startFlow(flow)
        Config -> Config: Check if flow exists
        
        alt Flow doesn't exist (new flow)
            Config --> BG: false (new flow)
            BG --> EmailExec: {success: true, data: false}
            
            EmailExec -> EmailExec: Log.withFlow(matcherId, id)\nCreate flow-specific log
            
            EmailExec -> Web: markEmailAsRead()\nFind & click 'Gelesen/Ungelesen'
            Web --> EmailExec: Email marked as read
            
            EmailExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'open', url: href}
            
            BG -> TabSvc: openTab(url, managed: true)
            activate TabSvc #SUCCESS
            TabSvc -> TabSvc: chrome.tabs.create()\nSet managed flag
            TabSvc --> BG: {tabId: newTabId}
            deactivate TabSvc
            
            BG --> EmailExec: {success: true, data: {tabId}}
            
            EmailExec -> EmailExec: processedCount++\nvisitedUrls[href] = true
        else Flow already exists
            Config --> BG: true (existing flow)
            BG --> EmailExec: {success: true, data: true}
            EmailExec -> EmailExec: Log: "Skipping existing flow"
        end
    end
    
    EmailExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
    note right: Result contains:\n- success: true\n- processedCount\n- visitedUrls\n- refreshSeconds\n- telemetry data
    deactivate EmailExec
    
    BG --> EmailCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>\n{success: true, data: result}
    deactivate BG
    
else Extension Disabled
    EmailCS -> EmailCS: Log: "Extension disabled"
end

deactivate EmailCS

== Phase 3: Item Page Processing ==

Web -> ItemCS: New tab opened\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/item.php)
activate ItemCS #PRIMARY

ItemCS -> ItemCS: checkAndRun()\nURL validation
note right of ItemCS: URL Pattern:\nhttps://auktion.hansemerkur.de/item.php

ItemCS -> ItemCS: FlowUtils.parseIDFromHref(currentUrl)\nExtract flow ID

ItemCS -> ItemCS: Log.withFlow(MATCHER_IDS.ITEM, id)\nCreate flow-specific log

ItemCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.getConfig')</color>
activate BG #WARNING
BG -> Config: getConfig()
Config --> BG: Configuration data
BG --> ItemCS: {config, enabled}
deactivate BG

ItemCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('item.clickProductLink')</color>
note right: Payload:\n- id: flow ID\n- selectors:\n  - buyButton: '.buy_now a.btn'\n  - titleLink: 'h1.item_title'

activate BG #WARNING

BG -> Config: getFlow(id)
Config --> BG: Flow data

BG -> Config: getProductStrategies()
Config --> BG: Product validation rules

BG -> ItemExec: chrome.scripting.executeScript()\n__itemExecutor(context, selectors, flowId)
activate ItemExec #PRIMARY

ItemExec -> ItemExec: isValidTimeOfDay(config)\nCheck operation hours
note right: Checks if current time\nis within configured\noperation hours

alt Within operation hours
    ItemExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'isManaged', tabId}
    BG -> TabSvc: isManaged(tabId)
    TabSvc --> BG: true
    BG --> ItemExec: {data: true}
    
    ItemExec -> Web: querySelector('.buy_now a.btn')
    Web --> ItemExec: Buy button element
    
    ItemExec -> Web: querySelector('h1.item_title')
    Web --> ItemExec: Product title text
    
    ItemExec -> ItemExec: ProductFactory.parse(config, productText)\nValidate product
    note right: Product validation:\n- Parse product details\n- Check against strategies\n- Determine if allowed
    
    alt Product is allowed
        ItemExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'open', url: buyButton.href}
        
        BG -> TabSvc: openTab(buyOfferUrl, managed: true)
        TabSvc -> TabSvc: chrome.tabs.create()
        TabSvc --> BG: {tabId: buyOfferTabId}
        BG --> ItemExec: {success: true, data: {tabId}}
    else Product not allowed
        ItemExec -> ItemExec: Log: "Product not allowed"
    end
else Outside operation hours
    ItemExec -> ItemExec: Schedule reload\nat next minute mark
end

ItemExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
deactivate ItemExec

BG --> ItemCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>
deactivate BG

deactivate ItemCS

== Phase 4: Buy Offer Processing ==

Web -> BuyCS: New tab opened\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/buy_now/id/*)
activate BuyCS #ERROR

BuyCS -> BuyCS: checkAndRun()\nURL & DOM validation
note right of BuyCS: DOM Preconditions:\n1. '.col-sm-9 h2' (product title)\n2. 'button[role="action"]' (buy button)\n3. '#captcha_code' (input field)\n4. '#page_buy_now_captcha label img' (captcha)

BuyCS -> BuyCS: FlowUtils.parseIDFromHref(currentUrl)\nExtract flow ID

BuyCS -> BuyCS: Log.withFlow(MATCHER_IDS.BUY_OFFER, flowId)

BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.getConfig')</color>
activate BG #WARNING
BG --> BuyCS: Configuration
deactivate BG

BuyCS -> Web: querySelector('#page_buy_now h2')
Web --> BuyCS: Product title element

BuyCS -> BuyCS: ProductFactory.parse(config, productText)\nValidate product

BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('state.buying')</color>\n{action: 'check', flowId}
activate BG #WARNING
BG -> BG: Check buying state\nPrevent duplicates
BG --> BuyCS: {data: {buying: false}}
deactivate BG

alt Not already buying
    BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('state.buying')</color>\n{action: 'mark', flowId, timeout}
    activate BG #WARNING
    BG -> BG: Mark as buying\nSet timeout
    BG --> BuyCS: Success
    deactivate BG
    
    BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('buyOffer.execute')</color>
    note right: Selectors:\n- input: '#captcha_code'\n- img: '#page_buy_now_captcha label img'\n- productTitle: '.col-sm-9 h2'\n- buyFormButton: 'button[role="action"]'
    
    activate BG #WARNING
    
    BG -> Config: getFlow(id)
    Config --> BG: Flow data
    
    BG -> BuyExec: chrome.scripting.executeScript()\n__buyOfferExecutor(context, selectors)
    activate BuyExec #ERROR
    
    == Phase 5: CAPTCHA Processing and Purchase ==
    
    BuyExec -> Web: waitForSelector('#captcha_code')
    Web --> BuyExec: Input element
    
    BuyExec -> Web: inputElement.focus()
    Web --> BuyExec: Input focused
    
    BuyExec -> Web: waitForSelector('#page_buy_now_captcha label img')
    Web --> BuyExec: Captcha image
    
    BuyExec -> BuyExec: fetchImageAsBlob(img.src)\nConvert to base64
    
    BuyExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('image.solve')</color>\n{imageData: base64}
    
    BG -> ImageAPI: processImageAPI(imageData)
    activate ImageAPI #WARNING
    ImageAPI -> ImageAPI: OCR Processing\nExtract math problem
    ImageAPI --> BG: {result: "answer"}
    deactivate ImageAPI
    
    BG --> BuyExec: {success: true, data: {result}}
    
    BuyExec -> BuyExec: extractNumericAnswer(result)\nParse answer
    
    BuyExec -> Web: inputElement.value = answer\ndispatchEvent('input')
    Web --> BuyExec: Answer entered
    
    BuyExec -> Config: getFlow(id)
    Config --> BuyExec: Flow with timestamp
    
    BuyExec -> BuyExec: ProductFactory.getRemainingProcessingTimeSeconds()\nCalculate delay
    note right: Calculates remaining time\nbased on product type\nand request timestamp
    
    BuyExec -> BuyExec: sleep(remainingTime * 1000)
    
    BuyExec -> Web: clickWithVerification(buyButton)\n{verify: true, scroll: true}
    Web --> BuyExec: Purchase submitted
    
    BuyExec -> BuyExec: sleep(500ms)\nWait for submission
    
    BuyExec -> Config: doneFlow(flowId)
    Config -> Config: Mark flow as completed
    Config --> BuyExec: Success
    
    BuyExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('state.buying')</color>\n{action: 'clear', flowId}
    BG -> BG: Clear buying state
    BG --> BuyExec: Success
    
    BuyExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
    note right: Final result:\n- success: true\n- flowId\n- product details\n- captchaProcessed: true\n- answer\n- completedAt timestamp\n- telemetry metrics
    deactivate BuyExec
    
    BG --> BuyCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>\n{success: true}
    deactivate BG
    
else Already being purchased
    BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'close', tabId}
    BG -> TabSvc: closeTab(tabId)
    TabSvc --> BG: Success
    BG --> BuyCS: Tab closed
end

deactivate BuyCS

@enduml

@startuml Flow_Route_2_Inbox_to_BuyOffer
!define PRIMARY #2E86AB
!define SUCCESS #A8DADC
!define WARNING #FFA400
!define ERROR #E63946
!define INFO #90C3C8
!define BACKGROUND #F1FAEE
!define SPECIAL #FF006E

skinparam backgroundColor BACKGROUND
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor PRIMARY
    BorderColor #1D3557
    FontColor white
    FontSize 14
    FontStyle bold
}
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1D3557
    ArrowFontSize 12
    LifeLineBackgroundColor SUCCESS
    LifeLineBorderColor #457B9D
    MessageAlign center
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor INFO
    BorderColor #457B9D
    FontSize 11
}

title <size:20><b>Flow Route 2: Inbox → MyOffer → Item → BuyOffer</b></size>\n<size:12>Complete Message Transfer and Processing Flow with Scheduled Reloads</size>

actor User #FFA400
participant "Content Script\n(Inbox Matcher)" as InboxCS
participant "Background Service\n(Message Router)" as BG
participant "Inbox Executor" as InboxExec
database "ConfigService\n(Chrome Storage)" as Config
participant "Tab Service" as TabSvc
participant "Content Script\n(MyOffer Matcher)" as MyOfferCS
participant "MyOffer Executor" as MyOfferExec
participant "Content Script\n(Item Matcher)" as ItemCS
participant "Item Executor" as ItemExec
participant "Content Script\n(BuyOffer Matcher)" as BuyCS
participant "BuyOffer Executor" as BuyExec
participant "Image API\n(OCR Service)" as ImageAPI
participant "Web Page\n(HanseMerkur)" as Web
database "Session Storage" as Session

== Phase 1: Inbox Monitoring and Scheduled Reloads ==

User -> Web: Navigate to Inbox\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/my_message_center_inbox.html)
activate Web #SUCCESS

Web -> InboxCS: Page Load Event\n[DOM Ready]
activate InboxCS #SPECIAL

InboxCS -> InboxCS: checkAndRun()\n- Validate URL pattern\n- Check DOM preconditions
note right of InboxCS: DOM Preconditions:\n- Selector: 'table'\n- shouldExist: true\n- timeout: 5000ms

InboxCS -> InboxCS: registerMatcher(inboxMatcher)\n- id: MATCHER_IDS.INBOX\n- priority: 10

InboxCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.getConfig')</color>
activate BG #WARNING
BG -> Config: getConfig()
activate Config #INFO
Config --> BG: {config, enabled}
deactivate Config
BG --> InboxCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>\n{config, enabled}
deactivate BG

alt Extension Enabled & Inbox Mode Active
    InboxCS -> Session: sessionStorage.getItem('inbox_scan_after_reload')
    activate Session #INFO
    
    alt Post-reload scan (value = '1')
        Session --> InboxCS: '1'
        InboxCS -> Session: sessionStorage.removeItem('inbox_scan_after_reload')
        deactivate Session
        InboxCS -> InboxCS: Log: "Performing post-reload scan"
        InboxCS -> InboxCS: sleep(config.inboxPostReloadDelayMs || 2000)
        InboxCS -> InboxCS: scanAndOpenLinks()
    else Initial scan
        Session --> InboxCS: null
        InboxCS -> InboxCS: scanAndOpenLinks()
    end
    
    InboxCS -> InboxCS: startReloadScheduler(config)
    note over InboxCS: Scheduler Configuration:\n- Reload at seconds: [0, 5]\n- Check every 1000ms\n- Auto-reload at matching seconds
    
    loop Every 1 second
        InboxCS -> InboxCS: Check current second
        alt Current second matches [0, 5]
            InboxCS -> Session: sessionStorage.setItem('inbox_scan_after_reload', '1')
            InboxCS -> Web: window.location.reload()
            note right: Page reloads and\nrestarts from Phase 1
        end
    end
    
    == Phase 2: Link Extraction and Processing ==
    
    group scanAndOpenLinks()
        InboxCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('inbox.openMyOfferLink')</color>
        note right: Selectors:\n- titleLinks: 'table a[href*="show_message"]'\n- messageRow: 'tr'\n- requestTimestampElement: 'td:nth-child(3)'
        
        activate BG #WARNING
        
        BG -> InboxExec: chrome.scripting.executeScript()\n__inboxExecutor(context, selectors)
        activate InboxExec #SPECIAL
        
        InboxExec -> Web: document.querySelectorAll('tr')
        Web --> InboxExec: Table rows
        
        loop For each row
            InboxExec -> Web: row.querySelector('a[href*="show_message"]')
            Web --> InboxExec: Title link
            
            InboxExec -> InboxExec: FlowUtils.parseIDFromTitle(title)\nExtract ID from title text
            note right: ID Pattern:\nExtracts alphanumeric ID\nfrom message title
            
            InboxExec -> Web: row.querySelector('td:nth-child(3)')\nGet timestamp cell
            Web --> InboxExec: Timestamp text
            
            InboxExec -> InboxExec: FlowUtils.parseDateToEpoch(timestampText)\nConvert to epoch
            
            InboxExec -> InboxExec: links.push({\n  id, href, title, requestTimestamp\n})
        end
        
        InboxExec -> InboxExec: links.sort((a,b) => b.requestTimestamp - a.requestTimestamp)\nSort by newest first
        
        InboxExec -> InboxExec: linksToProcess = links.slice(0, maxLinks)\nmaxLinks = config.inboxMaxLinksPerScan || 10
        
        loop For each link to process (newest first)
            InboxExec -> InboxExec: Log.withFlow(MATCHER_IDS.INBOX, link.id)\nCreate flow-specific log
            
            InboxExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.startFlow')</color>
            note right: Flow data:\n- type: 'inbox'\n- id: link.id\n- title: link.title\n- requestTimestamp: epoch\n- href: link.href
            
            BG -> Config: startFlow(flow)
            Config -> Config: Check if flow exists
            
            alt Flow doesn't exist (new flow)
                Config --> BG: false (new flow)
                BG --> InboxExec: {success: true, data: false}
                
                InboxExec -> InboxExec: visitedUrls[link.href] = true
                
                InboxExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'open', url: link.href}
                
                BG -> TabSvc: openTab(url, managed: true)
                activate TabSvc #SUCCESS
                TabSvc -> TabSvc: chrome.tabs.create()
                TabSvc --> BG: {tabId: newTabId}
                deactivate TabSvc
                
                BG --> InboxExec: {success: true, data: {tabId}}
                
                InboxExec -> InboxExec: openedCount++
                
                InboxExec -> InboxExec: sleep(interOpenDelay)\nDefault: 400ms
                note right: Delay between\nopening links
                
            else Flow already exists
                Config --> BG: true (existing flow)
                BG --> InboxExec: {success: true, data: true}
                InboxExec -> InboxExec: skippedCount++\nLog: "Flow already exists"
            end
        end
        
        InboxExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
        note right: Result contains:\n- success: true\n- links array with timestamps\n- telemetry data\n- opened/skipped counts
        deactivate InboxExec
        
        BG --> InboxCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>
        deactivate BG
    end
    
else Extension/Inbox Mode Disabled
    InboxCS -> InboxCS: Log: "Inbox monitoring disabled"
end

deactivate InboxCS

== Phase 3: MyOffer Message Processing ==

Web -> MyOfferCS: New tab opened\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/my_message_center_show_message.php)
activate MyOfferCS #SPECIAL

MyOfferCS -> MyOfferCS: checkAndRun()\nURL validation
note right of MyOfferCS: URL Pattern:\nmy_message_center_show_message.php

MyOfferCS -> MyOfferCS: FlowUtils.parseIDFromHref(currentUrl)\nExtract flow ID from URL parameters

MyOfferCS -> MyOfferCS: Log.withFlow(MATCHER_IDS.MY_OFFER, id)

MyOfferCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('extension.getConfig')</color>
activate BG #WARNING
BG -> Config: getConfig()
Config --> BG: Configuration data
BG --> MyOfferCS: {config, enabled}
deactivate BG

alt Extension Enabled
    MyOfferCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('myOffer.clickProductLink')</color>
    note right: Payload:\n- id: flow ID\n- selectors:\n  - itemLink: '#my_area table.message_center_message td.content a'\n  - titleLink: 'h1.item_title'\n  - requestTimestampElement: '.message_center_message thead tr td:last-child'
    
    activate BG #WARNING
    
    BG -> MyOfferExec: chrome.scripting.executeScript()\n__myOfferExecutor(context, selectors, flowId)
    activate MyOfferExec #SPECIAL
    
    MyOfferExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'isManaged', tabId}
    BG -> TabSvc: isManaged(tabId)
    TabSvc --> BG: true
    BG --> MyOfferExec: {data: true}
    
    MyOfferExec -> Web: querySelector('#my_area table.message_center_message td.content a')
    Web --> MyOfferExec: Item link element
    
    MyOfferExec -> Web: querySelector('h1.item_title')
    Web --> MyOfferExec: Product title
    
    MyOfferExec -> MyOfferExec: ProductFactory.parse(config, productText)\nValidate product
    
    alt Product is valid and allowed
        MyOfferExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'open', url: itemLink.href}
        
        BG -> TabSvc: openTab(itemUrl, managed: true)
        TabSvc -> TabSvc: chrome.tabs.create()
        TabSvc --> BG: {tabId: itemTabId}
        BG --> MyOfferExec: {success: true, data: {tabId}}
        
        MyOfferExec -> MyOfferExec: Log: "Opening item page"
    else Product not valid/allowed
        MyOfferExec -> MyOfferExec: Log: "Invalid product or not allowed"
    end
    
    MyOfferExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
    deactivate MyOfferExec
    
    BG --> MyOfferCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>
    deactivate BG
end

deactivate MyOfferCS

== Phase 4: Item Page Processing (Same as Route 1) ==

Web -> ItemCS: Item page opened\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/item.php)
activate ItemCS #PRIMARY

note over ItemCS, ItemExec: <b>Item Processing</b>\nSame flow as in Route 1:\n1. Extract flow ID from URL\n2. Check configuration\n3. Validate operation hours\n4. Parse and validate product\n5. Open buy offer page if allowed

ItemCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('item.clickProductLink')</color>
activate BG #WARNING

BG -> ItemExec: Execute item workflow
activate ItemExec #PRIMARY

ItemExec -> ItemExec: Process item\n(Same as Route 1)

ItemExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('tab.manage')</color>\n{action: 'open', url: buyOfferUrl}

BG -> TabSvc: openTab(buyOfferUrl, managed: true)
TabSvc --> BG: {tabId: buyOfferTabId}

BG --> ItemExec: Success

ItemExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>
deactivate ItemExec

BG --> ItemCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>
deactivate BG

deactivate ItemCS

== Phase 5: Buy Offer Processing (Same as Route 1) ==

Web -> BuyCS: Buy offer page opened\n(https://auktion.hansemerkur.de/buy_now/id/*)
activate BuyCS #ERROR

note over BuyCS, BuyExec: <b>Buy Offer Processing</b>\nSame flow as in Route 1:\n1. Validate DOM preconditions\n2. Check buying state (prevent duplicates)\n3. Process CAPTCHA with Image API\n4. Calculate and apply delays\n5. Submit purchase\n6. Mark flow as completed

BuyCS -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('buyOffer.execute')</color>
activate BG #WARNING

BG -> BuyExec: Execute buy offer workflow
activate BuyExec #ERROR

BuyExec -> BuyExec: Validate preconditions

BuyExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('state.buying')</color>\nCheck & mark buying state

BuyExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('image.solve')</color>\nProcess CAPTCHA

BG -> ImageAPI: processImageAPI(imageData)
activate ImageAPI #WARNING
ImageAPI --> BG: {result: "answer"}
deactivate ImageAPI

BG --> BuyExec: Solved CAPTCHA

BuyExec -> Web: Enter answer & submit purchase

BuyExec -> Config: doneFlow(flowId)
Config --> BuyExec: Flow marked complete

BuyExec -> BG: <color:blue>sendBackgroundCommand('state.buying')</color>\n{action: 'clear', flowId}

BuyExec --> BG: <color:green>ExecutionResult</color>\n{success: true, flowId, product, captchaProcessed}
deactivate BuyExec

BG --> BuyCS: <color:green>CommandResponse</color>
deactivate BG

deactivate BuyCS

note over InboxCS: <b>Continuous Monitoring</b>\nThe Inbox continues to reload\nat scheduled intervals (0s, 5s)\nprocessing new messages

@enduml